window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Make a wish. Listen to your heart. End the devil’s life...</p> <p>As the crew reach the shores of England, the power of a wish weighs heavy on Dianna’s shoulders. What should be a simple task snowballs into an endless pit of questions and second guesses as Dianna’s yet to mutter the words that will finally put an end to their formidable journey.</p> <p>Find her mother before Maria Cobham ends her life.</p> <p>The mission is simple, yet so much stands in the way. Including Roselyn Wallace, queen of the port and an old friend from Henry’s past. Time after time, Dianna reluctantly crosses paths with the tall, dark beauty until she finds herself in a world of trouble. Can she dig her way out before everything she’s worked for falls apart? Or will the world Dianna loves wash away with the unforgiving tides?</p> <p>Fans of <i>Outlander</i> and <i>Pirates of The Caribbean</i> give praise for <i>The Siren’s Call</i>! <br> </p>"; 
